	abstract = {Context: Neoadjuvant chemotherapy before radical cystectomy ({RC}) is the preferred initial option for muscle-invasive bladder cancer ({BCa}). As in rectal and breast cancer, pathologic downstaging is associated with increased overall survival ({OS}).},
