	abstract = {... In addition, subjects in the pro, con, and no reasons conditions were asked to make estimates about various placement center statistics from previous years, including the mean, median, and range of the ...  {COUNTERFACTUAL} {REASONING} {AND} {PREDICTIVE} {ACCURACY} 723 ...},
