	title = { Data mining/machine learning vs classical statistics  Why data mining/machine learning for clinical data?  Predictive versus prognosis effects  Data-driven versus “guidance driven” subgroup analysis  Taxonomy of biomarker identification methods  Software for subgroup identification. What features to look at?  Summary},
