Section: Research Methods \&amp; Reporting},
	file = {Full Text PDF:/Users/abhijit/Zotero/storage/TZZ7IA5D/Collins et al. - 2024 - Evaluation of clinical prediction models (part 1) from development to external validation.pdf:application/pdf},
